games/issue/ART-536/10-icons-for-ab-test-transforming-0-6-tiles-into-symbols-and-replace \"\u200c\") with sub tickets including loading screen and engineering implementation", "id": "65eb609caa6b13e130e40e1e", "idShort": 34, "name": "Testing Tiles Delight vs Domino Adventure", "shortLink": "AOWEFubl"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": "### Overview of the feature\n\n\u200c\n\nLinks to any documentation should be included on the card, or attached to the card, and checklists can be created to track the tasks or user stories to build the feature."}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2290", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6625f55e2cc80d497cca7056", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T05:27:58Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "66183d50c25a7d886c347a25", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"desc": "Streak announcer and showing texts like \u201cDivine\u201d \u201cDelicious\u201d on the screen when players make matches. There is a separate ticket for Marcus to make streak reward bar filling up in a juicy way. [PERSON_NAME_0040] had an idea on this but I don\u2019t have the details\n\nLinear Ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ART-552/ui-team-to-create-streak-announcer-text-effects \"\u200c\")", "id": "66183d50c25a7d886c347a25", "idShort": 39, "name": "streak announcer", "shortLink": "976Sbh4d"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": "Streak announcer and showing texts like \u201cDivine\u201d \u201cDelicious\u201d on the screen when players make matches. There is a separate ticket for Marcus to make streak reward bar filling up in a juicy way. [PERSON_NAME_0040] had an idea on this but I don\u2019t have the details"}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2291", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6625f6b1842022cc41951cb8", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T05:33:37Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "6624033319305570c484187b", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"desc": "\u200c\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6624033319305570c484187b/attachments/66241070f87146691776cc59/download/image.png)\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6624033319305570c484187b/attachments/6624109bb251b2e8e573123c/download/image.png)\n\nEngineering implementation ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-807/implement-new-memory-game-difficulty-selection-and-other-mini-game-ui \"\u200c\") parent ticket is the design and finalizing VFX.", "id": "6624033319305570c484187b", "idShort": 40, "name": "Memory Game Changes", "shortLink": "hnxgtWoI"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": "\u200c\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6624033319305570c484187b/attachments/66241070f87146691776cc59/download/image.png)\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6624033319305570c484187b/attachments/6624109bb251b2e8e573123c/download/image.png)"}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2292", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6625f8ac0270a88ff1468f59", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T05:42:04Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "6624061a7777adaf9d0c375a", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"desc": "1. **Automatic Actions**: When a player completes the highest level they have reached in a chapter, the system automatically moves their avatar to the next level and opens the pre-level dialog. This **eliminates** the need for the player to **manually select the level node for new levels**.\n2. **Player Control and Flexibility**: If players do not wish to proceed with the suggested next level, they can close the pre-level dialogue by hitting the X button and choose any previously completed level to replay. This allows for both automated progression and player-directed exploration.\n3. **Replay and Navigation**: To replay a level or navigate to a different one, players can dismiss the pre-level dialog and manually navigate the saga map to select their desired level.\n4. **Efficiency**: This new flow is designed to save players a click (by not requiring them to select a level node for new levels) and to simplify the process of progressing through levels, especially for less experienced players.\n5. **Conditions for Automation**: The auto-move and auto-click features are triggered only upon first completion of a level. For replays, these features do not engage automatically, giving control back to the players to navigate as they please. There is an exception for new sessions. When player starts a new session and returns to the game, we trigger auto-move and auto-click\n\nThis new system seems aimed at enhancing user experience by reducing repetitive tasks and maintaining engagement by swiftly moving players through the game, while still providing options for those who prefer more control over their gameplay.\n\nLinear ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-805/implement-auto-triggering-for-pre-level-dialogue-for-new-levels \"\u200c\")", "id": "6624061a7777adaf9d0c375a", "idShort": 41, "name": "Level Node Flow Update", "shortLink": "SXNVDCYm"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": "1. **Automatic Actions**: When a player completes the highest level they have reached in a chapter, the system automatically moves their avatar to the next level and opens the pre-level dialog. This **eliminates** the need for the player to **manually select the level node for new levels**.\n2. **Player Control and Flexibility**: If players do not wish to proceed with the suggested next level, they can close the pre-level dialogue by hitting the X button and choose any previously completed level to replay. This allows for both automated progression and player-directed exploration.\n3. **Replay and Navigation**: To replay a level or navigate to a different one, players can dismiss the pre-level dialog and manually navigate the saga map to select their desired level.\n4. **Efficiency**: This new flow is designed to save players a click (by not requiring them to select a level node for new levels) and to simplify the process of progressing through levels, especially for less experienced players.\n5. **Conditions for Automation**: The auto-move and auto-click features are triggered only upon first completion of a level. For replays, these features do not engage automatically, giving control back to the players to navigate as they please. There is an exception for new sessions. When player starts a new session and returns to the game, we trigger auto-move and auto-click\n\nThis new system seems aimed at enhancing user experience by reducing repetitive tasks and maintaining engagement by swiftly moving players through the game, while still providing options for those who prefer more control over their gameplay."}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2293", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6625fa4bd27a31a3450af4c8", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T05:48:59Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "66240b3ea24eabd318d450f1", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"desc": "We need a tutorial showing how to unlock Nathan once the token is received, how you can select Nathan from the pre-level dialogue. We also need to add Nathan as a milestone-preview rewards. We need 2 separate tickets.\n\nSee more detail in FTUE Nathan ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/DES-108/nathan-tutorial \"\u200c\")", "id": "66240b3ea24eabd318d450f1", "idShort": 46, "name": "Nathan Tutorial", "shortLink": "E9myKTMa"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": "We need a tutorial showing how to unlock [PERSON_NAME_7904] once the token is received, how you can select [PERSON_NAME_7904] from the pre-level dialogue. We also need to add [PERSON_NAME_7904] as a milestone-preview rewards. We need 2 separate tickets."}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2294", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6625facdab96731c92473981", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T05:51:09Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "66240b3ea24eabd318d450f1", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"desc": "We need a tutorial showing how to unlock Nathan once the token is received, how you can select Nathan from the pre-level dialogue. We also need to add Nathan as a milestone-preview rewards. We need 2 separate tickets.\n\nSee more detail in FTUE Nathan ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/DES-108/nathan-tutorial \"\u200c\")\n\nBe able to preview when a specific character token will drop using milestone/feature preview system ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-808/figure-out-how-to-preview-character-token-as-milestone-preview \"\u200c\")", "id": "66240b3ea24eabd318d450f1", "idShort": 46, "name": "Nathan Tutorial", "shortLink": "E9myKTMa"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": "We need a tutorial showing how to unlock Nathan once the token is received, how you can select Nathan from the pre-level dialogue. We also need to add Nathan as a milestone-preview rewards. We need 2 separate tickets.\n\nSee more detail in FTUE Nathan ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/DES-108/nathan-tutorial \"\u200c\")"}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2295", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6625fadfe5d3bed44641ea67", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T05:51:27Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "66240b3ea24eabd318d450f1", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"id": "66240b3ea24eabd318d450f1", "idShort": 46, "name": "Nathan Tutorial + Character Token as Feature Milestone Preview", "shortLink": "E9myKTMa"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"name": "Nathan Tutorial"}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2296", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6625fcf12b29926aa7991198", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T06:00:17Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "66240c6e12ddb47294ee2918", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"desc": "![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/66240c6e12ddb47294ee2918/attachments/66240e60161ff4a988cb47a2/download/image.png)\n\nNeed to implement the new assets, new +5 tile booster that can be only bought with coins at level ends, and new flow. We need ability to \u201ctap here to see the board\u201d functionality. Let\u2019s make our level endings great again\n\nLinear ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-809/implement-a-new-end-game-flow \"\u200c\") with more details on how this flows.", "id": "66240c6e12ddb47294ee2918", "idShort": 48, "name": "End of Level flow update", "shortLink": "AZtcLBP8"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": "![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/66240c6e12ddb47294ee2918/attachments/66240e60161ff4a988cb47a2/download/image.png)\n\nNeed to implement the new assets, new +5 tile booster that can be only bought with coins at level ends, and new flow. We need ability to \u201ctap here to see the board\u201d functionality. Let\u2019s make our level endings great again"}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2297", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6625fddc0608781210dbd728", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T06:04:12Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "66240ec36581796efd8b08e4", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"desc": "Master ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-625/level-objectives-for-star-ranking \"\u200c\")\n\n4/20/2024: it seems like we are just waiting on engineering implementation along with UI overhaul.", "id": "66240ec36581796efd8b08e4", "idShort": 49, "name": "Finish implementing other level objectives", "shortLink": "kneKyUqk"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": ""}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2298", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6625fe3d89c36b1e034c2dc7", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T06:05:49Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "6624104e91f7f3eb4fa1ebea", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"desc": "The related linear ticket is [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ART-540/need-visual-elements-to-lock-the-memory-game-until-its-unlocked-also \"\u200c\")\n\nThe goal is to make the mini games more visually prominent so players know they are clickable.", "id": "6624104e91f7f3eb4fa1ebea", "idShort": 52, "name": "Mini-game hub accessiblity", "shortLink": "sHI2p1YK"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": ""}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2299", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6625fe7a7fcc6d5f140ead94", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T06:06:50Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "66241271a2601dcdc3dfa5f1", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"desc": "One follow up item from board meeting is looking up where domino dreams is scaling their campaigns in domino loving countries. This means we need to update all app stores text and assets, all in-game texts.\n\nLinear Ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/DES-109/localize-marketing-text-to-spanish-for-marketing-campaigns \"\u200c\")", "id": "66241271a2601dcdc3dfa5f1", "idShort": 57, "name": "Localize game to Spanish", "shortLink": "A2bpuaKs"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": "One follow up item from board meeting is looking up where domino dreams is scaling their campaigns in domino loving countries. This means we need to update all app stores text and assets, all in-game texts."}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2300", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6625fec86a3a8d419b4c2622", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T06:08:08Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "6624250e88ed1361111afc45", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"desc": "Linear ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/DES-110/in-depth-river-tile-game-ftue \"\u200c\")", "id": "6624250e88ed1361111afc45", "idShort": 60, "name": "New conveyor belt tutorial with more steps", "shortLink": "qLcPp1B2"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": ""}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2301", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6625fecf533ad0c9bf71846e", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T06:08:15Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "6624250e88ed1361111afc45", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"id": "6624250e88ed1361111afc45", "idLabels": ["65eb4ec525346c8070ca6411"], "idShort": 60, "name": "New conveyor belt tutorial with more steps", "shortLink": "qLcPp1B2"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"idLabels": []}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2302", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6625ff5052eaa0c730ed2824", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T06:10:24Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "66244bfd64d65676450d2cfd", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"desc": "Linear ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/DES-111/new-vanishing-tile-ftue \"\u200c\")", "id": "66244bfd64d65676450d2cfd", "idShort": 61, "name": "Vanishing Tile tutorial improvements (for fail state ESpecially)", "shortLink": "zF0iERi1"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": ""}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2303", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6625ff79df71468c96ef5c44", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T06:11:05Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "662411071cc91794db394686", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"desc": "There are tickets for this task already. The tutorial text were blocking the game for Tablets. If we solve for this we can start buying also tablet users.\n\nTicket in Linear [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-780/handle-tablet-text-more-gracefully \"\u200c\")", "id": "662411071cc91794db394686", "idShort": 53, "name": "Tablets text tutorial repositioning", "shortLink": "cmyokyHv"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": "There are tickets for this task already. The tutorial text were blocking the game for Tablets. If we solve for this we can start buying also tablet users. Ping Leonard to get the tickets in linear"}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2304", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "66260008d1ffd474b154fab2", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T06:13:28Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "66240f1c8275b96008e2c5c1", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"desc": "![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/66240f1c8275b96008e2c5c1/attachments/66240fb5422ef2ef36a6408b/download/image.png)\n\nWheel menu was a bust. We disabled wheel menu already. We need to change the UI again to accomondate boosters at the bottom.\n\nWe also need a new tutorial for how to use the bomb booster.\n\nLinear ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-788/new-core-game-ui \"\u200c\")", "id": "66240f1c8275b96008e2c5c1", "idShort": 51, "name": "Update in-level UI", "shortLink": "DkBC6fea"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": "![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/66240f1c8275b96008e2c5c1/attachments/66240fb5422ef2ef36a6408b/download/image.png)\n\nWheel menu was a bust. We disabled wheel menu already. We need to change the UI again to accomondate boosters at the bottom.\n\nWe also need a new tutorial for how to use the bomb booster."}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2305", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6626a07b9a374281029af862", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T17:38:03Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "65eb514ba258edc23dae8f8a", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"desc": "### Overview of the feature\n\n\u200c\n\nLinks to any documentation should be included on the card, or attached to the card, and checklists can be created to track the tasks or user stories to build the feature.\n\nLinear Ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-787/add-zones-to-game \"\u200c\")", "id": "65eb514ba258edc23dae8f8a", "idShort": 7, "name": "Add Snow Chapters", "shortLink": "GrvQQhnt"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": "### Overview of the feature\n\n\u200c\n\nLinks to any documentation should be included on the card, or attached to the card, and checklists can be created to track the tasks or user stories to build the feature.\n\nlinear Ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-687/integrate-snow-art \"\u200c\")"}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2307", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6626a5162fb9d25abf58585b", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T17:57:42Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "66240673997aff10ad0dd707", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"desc": "New chapters have the following pacing: [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit#gid=66041835](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit#gid=66041835 \"smartCard-inline\")\n\nThe goal is to divide especially early chapters into smaller chunks such that players will be closer to the \u201cnext thing to chase\u201d before they are tired out of their sessions.\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/66240673997aff10ad0dd707/attachments/662406c94d146a635da6fba1/download/image.png)\n\n\u200c\n\nLinear Ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ENG-823/change-chapter-length-for-some-earlier-chapters \"\u200c\")", "id": "66240673997aff10ad0dd707", "idShort": 44, "name": "Chapter length changes", "shortLink": "JxM7aOIe"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": "New chapters have the following pacing: [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit#gid=66041835](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit#gid=66041835 \"smartCard-inline\")\n\nThe goal is to divide especially early chapters into smaller chunks such that players will be closer to the \u201cnext thing to Chase\u201d before they are tired out of their sessions.\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/66240673997aff10ad0dd707/attachments/662406c94d146a635da6fba1/download/image.png)"}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2308", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6626a733db847845a5d384fe", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T18:06:43Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "6624087975d53db7db32f7a8", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"desc": "Currently the Hero loop is underoptimized. Player spend very little amount of their playtime upgrading their heros and interacting with them. We also know they are looking for some place to spend their coins on their early journey. I would like to solve these 2 problems together by increasing the number of hero level upgrades from 5 levels to 40 levels. We preserve the bigger ability boosts and use them at level 10, 20, 30, 40.  The in-between levels will increase the amount of coins earned for the 4-streak rewards.  Please see the new structure here: [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit#gid=855125093](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit#gid=855125093 \"smartCard-inline\")\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6624087975d53db7db32f7a8/attachments/66240952338a6bd2d4e85fcd/download/image.png)\n\nIn addition, we\u2019ll adjust the hero tokens drop rate quite a bit and making hero tokens part of the daily routine.\n\nHere is the new drop table for characters. We need a couple tickets here.\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6624087975d53db7db32f7a8/attachments/66241338d5f02aa6e36b8198/download/image.png)\n\nTicket for adjusting the drop rates. - Engineering Team\n\nTicket for showing the drop rate on epic level as 2x, and boss level as 3x tokens. (Pre level dialog + Saga map) - UI Team\n\nTicket for making any level drop token for the first try in Chapter 1 after character token tutorial. (Design team locate excel table on token behavior and drop rate)\n\nTicket for updating drop rates after Nathan\u2019s unlock such that level drop Nathan or Sophie token.\n\nAnother ticket is needed to update the character screen so that it can accommodate new currency consumption in between levels and show 40 characters somehow", "id": "6624087975d53db7db32f7a8", "idShort": 45, "name": "Tightening the Character Loop", "shortLink": "K0pbCCXF"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": "Currently the Hero loop is underoptimized. Player spend very little amount of their playtime upgrading their heros and interacting with them. We also know they are looking for some place to spend their coins on their early journey. I would like to solve these 2 problems together by increasing the number of hero level upgrades from 5 levels to 40 levels. We preserve the bigger ability boosts and use them at level 10, 20, 30, 40.  The in-between levels will increase the amount of coins earned for the 4-streak rewards.  Please see the new structure here: [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit#gid=855125093](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit#gid=855125093 \"smartCard-inline\")\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6624087975d53db7db32f7a8/attachments/66240952338a6bd2d4e85fcd/download/image.png)\n\nIn addition, we\u2019ll adjust the hero tokens drop rate quite a bit and making hero tokens part of the daily routine.\n\nHere is the new drop table for characters. We need a couple tickets here.\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6624087975d53db7db32f7a8/attachments/66241338d5f02aa6e36b8198/download/image.png)\n\nTicket for adjusting the drop rates.\n\nTicket for showing the drop rate on epic level as 2x, and boss level as 3x tokens.\n\nTicket for making any level drop token for the first try in Chapter 1 after character token tutorial.\n\nTicket for updating drop rates after Nathan\u2019s unlock such that level drop Nathan or sophie token.\n\nAnother ticket is needed to update the character screen so that it can accommodate new currency consumption in between levels and show 40 characters somehow"}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2309", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6626a7a0a43c2a22a2122a09", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2024-04-22T18:08:32Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "idCard": "6624087975d53db7db32f7a8", "data": {"board": {"id": "65eb4ec525346c8070ca638f", "name": "Product Roadmap", "shortLink": "Yg3yTuCR"}, "card": {"desc": "Currently the Hero loop is underoptimized. Player spend very little amount of their playtime upgrading their heros and interacting with them. We also know they are looking for some place to spend their coins on their early journey. I would like to solve these 2 problems together by increasing the number of hero level upgrades from 5 levels to 40 levels. We preserve the bigger ability boosts and use them at level 10, 20, 30, 40.  The in-between levels will increase the amount of coins earned for the 4-streak rewards.  Please see the new structure here: [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit#gid=855125093](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit#gid=855125093 \"smartCard-inline\")\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6624087975d53db7db32f7a8/attachments/66240952338a6bd2d4e85fcd/download/image.png)\n\nIn addition, we\u2019ll adjust the hero tokens drop rate quite a bit and making hero tokens part of the daily routine.\n\nHere is the new drop table for characters. We need a couple tickets here.\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6624087975d53db7db32f7a8/attachments/66241338d5f02aa6e36b8198/download/image.png)\n\nTicket for adjusting the drop rates. - Engineering Team\n\nTicket for showing the drop rate on epic level as 2x, and boss level as 3x tokens. (Pre level dialog + Saga map) - UI Team\n\nTicket for making any level drop token for the first try in Chapter 1 after character token tutorial. (Design team locate excel table on token behavior and drop rate)\n\nTicket for updating drop rates after Nathan\u2019s unlock such that level drop Nathan or Sophie token.\n\nAnother ticket is needed to update the character screen so that it can accommodate new currency consumption in between levels and show 40 characters somehow (UI tool tip ticket [HERE](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ART-532/need-tooltips-for-character-screens-and-abilities \"\u200c\"))", "id": "6624087975d53db7db32f7a8", "idShort": 45, "name": "Tightening the Character Loop", "shortLink": "K0pbCCXF"}, "list": {"id": "6616cca4197aa0d93d92f329", "name": "Leonardo"}, "old": {"desc": "Currently the Hero loop is underoptimized. Player spend very little amount of their playtime upgrading their heros and interacting with them. We also know they are looking for some place to spend their coins on their early journey. I would like to solve these 2 problems together by increasing the number of hero level upgrades from 5 levels to 40 levels. We preserve the bigger ability boosts and use them at level 10, 20, 30, 40.  The in-between levels will increase the amount of coins earned for the 4-streak rewards.  Please see the new structure here: [https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit#gid=855125093](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1D3j_CpC5Y2K3l3W_VIZQ_mjr1_pTf_tY9oXyzsEe3xM/edit#gid=855125093 \"smartCard-inline\")\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6624087975d53db7db32f7a8/attachments/66240952338a6bd2d4e85fcd/download/image.png)\n\nIn addition, we\u2019ll adjust the hero tokens drop rate quite a bit and making hero tokens part of the daily routine.\n\nHere is the new drop table for characters. We need a couple tickets here.\n\n![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6624087975d53db7db32f7a8/attachments/66241338d5f02aa6e36b8198/download/image.png)\n\nTicket for adjusting the drop rates. - Engineering Team\n\nTicket for showing the drop rate on epic level as 2x, and boss level as 3x tokens. (Pre level dialog + Saga map) - UI Team\n\nTicket for making any level drop token for the first try in Chapter 1 after character token tutorial. (Design team locate excel table on token behavior and drop rate)\n\nTicket for updating drop rates after Nathan\u2019s unlock such that level drop Nathan or sophie token.\n\nAnother ticket is needed to update the character screen so that it can accommodate new currency consumption in between levels and show 40 characters somehow"}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/2310", "field": "idMemberCreator"