ison. The first tick happens 1 second after impact, and not AT impact. Other properties mechanics clean up ticket HERE", "shortLink": "fQwMQ1D0"}, "list": {"id": "6851a6608b76856437112e45", "name": "Jun 30th"}, "old": {"closed": false}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/4785", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6855f356fa0d08324de13e74", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2025-06-20T23:48:38Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "idCard": "6851a99f96cf86edd0045846", "data": {"board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "card": {"closed": true, "dateClosed": "2025-06-20T23:48:38.344Z", "id": "6851a99f96cf86edd0045846", "idShort": 17, "name": "Fix double boss spawning issues (throwing off balance)", "shortLink": "925TdGP4"}, "list": {"id": "6851a6608b76856437112e45", "name": "Jun 30th"}, "old": {"closed": false}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/4786", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6855f3574eacfb117a897c39", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2025-06-20T23:48:39Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "idCard": "6851a99af19c6e297dd449b7", "data": {"board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "card": {"closed": true, "dateClosed": "2025-06-20T23:48:39.778Z", "id": "6851a99af19c6e297dd449b7", "idShort": 16, "name": "Fix kill cam related issue with DoT effects (premature level ending, item hitting air)", "shortLink": "KkgoeagT"}, "list": {"id": "6851a6608b76856437112e45", "name": "Jun 30th"}, "old": {"closed": false}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/4787", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6855f3590165363c173c2d60", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2025-06-20T23:48:41Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "idCard": "6851aab2d2895068cb026566", "data": {"board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "card": {"closed": true, "dateClosed": "2025-06-20T23:48:41.389Z", "id": "6851aab2d2895068cb026566", "idShort": 20, "name": "KNOWN BUGS BELOW", "shortLink": "YJRI6SD1"}, "list": {"id": "6851a6608b76856437112e45", "name": "Jun 30th"}, "old": {"closed": false}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/4788", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6855f365aec00be9c216650d", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2025-06-20T23:48:53Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "idCard": "6851aaf52fe5548a10258090", "data": {"board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "card": {"id": "6851aaf52fe5548a10258090", "idShort": 21, "name": "[Improvement] QoL Features for Level Design Tool (Blake)", "shortLink": "oYisH1Uu"}, "list": {"id": "6851a6608b76856437112e45", "name": "Jun 30th"}, "old": {"name": "QoL Features for Level Design (Blake)"}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/4789", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6855fe7e601b4d836a460570", "type": "addAttachmentToCard", "date": "2025-06-21T00:36:14Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "idCard": "6851aaf52fe5548a10258090", "data": {"attachment": {"id": "6855fe7d601b4d836a46055b", "name": "image.png", "previewUrl": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6851aaf52fe5548a10258090/attachments/6855fe7d601b4d836a46055b/previews/preview/download/image.webp", "previewUrl2x": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6851aaf52fe5548a10258090/attachments/6855fe7d601b4d836a46055b/previews/preview2x/download/image.webp", "url": "https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6851aaf52fe5548a10258090/attachments/6855fe7d601b4d836a46055b/download/image.png"}, "board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "card": {"id": "6851aaf52fe5548a10258090", "idShort": 21, "name": "[Improvement] QoL Features for Level Design Tool (Blake)", "shortLink": "oYisH1Uu"}, "list": {"id": "6851a6608b76856437112e45", "name": "Jun 30th"}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/4790", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6855fe9d367c4c8422ac6fc7", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2025-06-21T00:36:45Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "idCard": "6851aaf52fe5548a10258090", "data": {"board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "card": {"desc": "- The set count needs to update properly when switching between difficulty tier tabs\n- Need a function that can copy a monster track settings from one difficulty tier to another. Need that same function for items as well. Currently this is done via manually deleting the added tier difficulty element in the scriptable object and re-adding the tier to \u201cclone\u201d\n- Need a function that can easily swap the name and level location of 2 levels. Currently it\u2019s an unclean and risky renaming fest where we set temporary level names to one of the levels being swapped, and we rename the next file, and go back and rename the temp named file. Doing this action on the scriptable level object itself will cause errors.\n- Need a function to delete difficulty tiers or reassign them to a specific tier (-1, 0, 1, etc.)\n- Consider migrating the list of items and list of monsters to be added to a third display. Freeing up the entire primary display for list of items and list of monsters when editing the monster or item tabs.\n- Clicking on monster icons should add the monster just like with items instead of having to click the small '+' sign\n- Remove the legacy 2nd item count slider that was meant for.\n- Badass feature would be to allow ctrl click multiple difficulty tier tabs. When this is done, all the edits are applied to all checked tier tabs. So adding items or monsters would make changes to all\n  ![image.png](https://PERSON_6092_TRELLO_USERNAME.com/1/cards/6851aaf52fe5548a10258090/attachments/6855fe7d601b4d836a46055b/download/image.png)\n  Also added a delete button", "id": "6851aaf52fe5548a10258090", "idShort": 21, "name": "[Improvement] QoL Features for Level Design Tool (Blake)", "shortLink": "oYisH1Uu"}, "list": {"id": "6851a6608b76856437112e45", "name": "Jun 30th"}, "old": {"desc": "We need a list"}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/4791", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6856400b5f822e5739266b02", "type": "createCard", "date": "2025-06-21T05:15:55Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "idCard": "6856400b5f822e5739266aea", "data": {"board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "card": {"id": "6856400b5f822e5739266aea", "idShort": 35, "name": "[Tools] A/B test tool for levels, FTUE, unlocks, etc.", "shortLink": "naXgNWfg"}, "list": {"id": "6851a6608b76856437112e45", "name": "Jun 30th"}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/4792", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6856400ee2c3d5893e3c2457", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2025-06-21T05:15:58Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "idCard": "6856400b5f822e5739266aea", "data": {"board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "card": {"id": "6856400b5f822e5739266aea", "idShort": 35, "name": "[Tools] A/B test tool for levels, FTUE, unlocks, etc.", "pos": 140737488456704, "shortLink": "naXgNWfg"}, "list": {"id": "6851a6608b76856437112e45", "name": "Jun 30th"}, "old": {"pos": 140737488479232}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/4793", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6856418f80e907160b462a87", "type": "createCard", "date": "2025-06-21T05:22:23Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "idCard": "6856418f80e907160b462a6f", "data": {"board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "card": {"id": "6856418f80e907160b462a6f", "idShort": 36, "name": "[Feature] Dynamic Item Removal Based on Win Streak Rewards", "shortLink": "QpC4geS1"}, "list": {"id": "6851a6608b76856437112e45", "name": "Jun 30th"}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/4794", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "685641f24b757561ad8c78e3", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2025-06-21T05:24:02Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "idCard": "6856418f80e907160b462a6f", "data": {"board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "card": {"desc": "At start of each level:\n\n1. Sort all unique items by attack power from lowest to highest.\n2. Find the bottom 3 weakest object.\n3. Remove X sets randomly selected from these 3 weakest object, where X = player\u2019s win streak level.\n4. Max removal = 5 because win streak max level is 5", "id": "6856418f80e907160b462a6f", "idShort": 36, "name": "[Feature] Dynamic Item Removal Based on Win Streak Rewards", "shortLink": "QpC4geS1"}, "list": {"id": "6851a6608b76856437112e45", "name": "Jun 30th"}, "old": {"desc": ""}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/4795", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "685641fd53dc8b21cdcef7b9", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2025-06-21T05:24:13Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "idCard": "6856418f80e907160b462a6f", "data": {"board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "card": {"desc": "At start of each level:\n\n1. Sort all unique items by attack power from lowest to highest.\n2. Find the bottom 3 weakest object.\n3. Remove X sets randomly selected from these 3 weakest object, where X = player\u2019s win streak level.\n4. Max removal = 5 because win streak max level is 5\n\nLevel is now decluttered", "id": "6856418f80e907160b462a6f", "idShort": 36, "name": "[Feature] Dynamic Item Removal Based on Win Streak Rewards", "shortLink": "QpC4geS1"}, "list": {"id": "6851a6608b76856437112e45", "name": "Jun 30th"}, "old": {"desc": "At start of each level:\n\n1. Sort all unique items by attack power from lowest to highest.\n2. Find the bottom 3 weakest object.\n3. Remove X sets randomly selected from these 3 weakest object, where X = player\u2019s win streak level.\n4. max removal = 5 because win streak max level is 5"}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/4796", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "68564207a9b285f04606d1a9", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2025-06-21T05:24:23Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "idCard": "6856418f80e907160b462a6f", "data": {"board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "card": {"desc": "At start of each level:\n\n1. Sort all unique items by attack power from lowest to highest.\n2. Find the bottom 3 weakest object.\n3. Remove X sets randomly selected from these 3 weakest object, where X = player\u2019s win streak level.\n4. Max removal = 5 because win streak max level is 5\n\nLevel is now decluttered, this processes after dynamic insertion.", "id": "6856418f80e907160b462a6f", "idShort": 36, "name": "[Feature] Dynamic Item Removal Based on Win Streak Rewards", "shortLink": "QpC4geS1"}, "list": {"id": "6851a6608b76856437112e45", "name": "Jun 30th"}, "old": {"desc": "At start of each level:\n\n1. Sort all unique items by attack power from lowest to highest.\n2. Find the bottom 3 weakest object.\n3. Remove X sets randomly selected from these 3 weakest object, where X = player\u2019s win streak level.\n4. max removal = 5 because win streak max level is 5\n\nLevel is now decluttered"}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/4797", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "6858fb6804b62b1406c4fbfd", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2025-06-23T06:59:52Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "idCard": "6851a7d6f0c13969bd1c39e1", "data": {"board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "card": {"desc": "Provide engineering estimate based on the Endless Mode GDD\n\nLink [HERE](https://docs.google.com/document/d/1AbwbcstoKYqjAdRUcooeLNjRzoe7VeU5G-Qz6ibrdiI/edit?tab=t.0 \"\u200c\")\n\nChatGPT Summary\n\n## \ud83e\udde9 **Endless Mode \u2013 Engineering Summary**\n\n### \ud83d\udd27 Initial Setup\n\n- Game starts with **40\u201345 sets** (a set = 3 items).\n- **8 unique item types**, with size distribution:\n  - 2 Large, 4 Medium, 2 Small.\n- Entire **item pool is defined by the designer** for each endless variant.\n- Monsters also follow **30-second \"tracks\"**, authored by designers using level editor tools.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udd04 Refill System (Every 30 seconds)\n\n1. **Track matched items** from the last 30 seconds.\n2. **Refill those exact items** to keep total set count at 40\u201345.\n3. Each refill is simulated and checked against a **growing Unique Item Cap**:\n\nRefill #Time (s)Unique Cap130826093909412010.........1236014\n\n---\n\n### \ud83e\udde0 Refill Logic Rules\n\n1. **Simulate a refill**: Replace all matched items 1:1.\n2. **Count unique items** on the new board.\n3. If unique count is **below cap**:\n   - Attempt to **substitute refilled items** with new unique items one-by-one.\n   - After each substitution, re-check unique count.\n4. If still short:\n   - Remove a **fraction of total sets** = `#missingUniques / targetUniqueCap`.\n   - Replace them with random sets using new unique items to reach the cap.\n\n**Key principle:** Total number of sets never changes; only uniqueness does.\n\n---\n\n### \ud83d\udca5 New Mechanic: The Nuke (Replaces Boss Buster)\n\n- **Builds power** by matching items:\n  `NukePower += itemAttackPower \u00d7 10% \u00d7 comboMultiplier`\n- **Combo System**:\n  - Starts at **1x**.\n  - Combo meter fills after each match and **decays** over time.\n  - If matched before timeout, combo increases.\n  - Decay window shrinks by 0.25s each level (starts at 4.5s).\n  - Max achievable combo: 18x.\n  - The **next match** receives the combo multiplier shown.\n\nComboTimeout2x4.5s3x4.25s......18x~0s\n\n- **Minimum power to activate Nuke** = 50.\n- UI: Glowing Nuke icon appears when ready, with tick-up text animation as power grows.", "id": "6851a7d6f0c13969bd1c39e1", "idShort": 14, "name": "[Feature] Endless Mode", "shortLink": "rD4ZvxeE"}, "list": {"id": "6851a6608b76856437112e45", "name": "Jun 30th"}, "old": {"desc": ""}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/4798", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "68597c197c9cf410c41f83c0", "type": "addMemberToBoard", "date": "2025-06-23T16:08:57Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "idCard": null, "data": {"board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "idMemberAdded": "PERSON_6096_TRELLO_USER_ID", "memberType": "admin"}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/4799", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "685981a3361acb1e4aa9e389", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2025-06-23T16:32:35Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "idCard": "68535478e8291fa4457d892c", "data": {"board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "card": {"id": "68535478e8291fa4457d892c", "idShort": 33, "name": "[Customer Service] Help Shift Integration", "pos": 140737488445440, "shortLink": "x3dPbWHm"}, "list": {"id": "6851a6608b76856437112e45", "name": "Jun 30th"}, "old": {"pos": 140737488306176}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/4800", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "685981a89f735def5e0982a4", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2025-06-23T16:32:40Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6095_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "idCard": "6851a7d6f0c13969bd1c39e1", "data": {"board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "card": {"id": "6851a7d6f0c13969bd1c39e1", "idShort": 14, "name": "[Feature] Endless Mode", "pos": 140737488330752, "shortLink": "rD4ZvxeE"}, "list": {"id": "6851a6608b76856437112e45", "name": "Jun 30th"}, "old": {"pos": 140737488355328}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trel