68e", "data": {"board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "card": {"desc": "- Red dots missing\n- Consecutive login quest not working\n- [Hard crash](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-475/consecutive-glass-impact-sfxvfx-causes-crash-on-android \"\u200c\") bug on Android after consecutive glass VFX/SFX\n- [Zombie track spawn is not consistent](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-438/investigate-why-some-zombie-tracks-do-not-spawn \"\u200c\") and causes level design imbalance.\n- [Fast matching targets an already dead zombies](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-535/fast-matching-might-target-an-already-dead-zombie \"\u200c\").\n  - it's still happens for samsung devices, that's why I couldn't repro.\n- Premature ending in levels containing Chef [\\@[PERSON_NAME_0055]](https://harmonygamesgroup.slack.com/team/U04TWDMDT0V \"\u200c\")\n  - lvl 12, lvl 33, and lvl 93\n- On Android, if I home out during a level, and home back in, my sound completely disappears. And if I were to finish a level, I hard freeze at end game victory screen\n  - Doesn't happen to me, might be again a Samsung issue but I need to see video\n- [List of UI issues](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-498/fixing-ui-elements-on-home-screen \"\u200c\") listed for various parts of the game.\n  - The trampoline UI is not consistent across icons and 3d model.\n  - Tornado icon is too low-res.\n- [Overheating](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-359/phone-heating-up-too-much-after-playing-15-to-20-levels \"\u200c\") still happens but it's in a better situation.\n- The first time loss after [win streak doesn't reset](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-520/first-loss-as-level-doesnt-reset-win-streak \"\u200c\") the win streak.\n- Poison effect in [kill cam causes perceived unresponsiveness](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-477/dot-kills-can-take-too-long-and-cause-perceived-unresponsivenes \"\u200c\") \u2013 UX feels frozen needs product decision.\n- Zombie Health [bar persists too long](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-481/zombie-health-bar-persists-too-long-after-death \"\u200c\") which causes visual clutter along with miscalculated object targets\n- [Implementing videos to FTUE funnel](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-500/add-additional-step-to-ftue-at-level-start-with-overlay \"\u200c\")", "id": "68c451141c69fb8af1b4568e", "idShort": 58, "name": "Minor Bugs to Fix", "shortLink": "cXpOQq99"}, "list": {"id": "6851a674975da1fe76e70d93", "name": "BETA: Sep 30"}, "old": {"desc": "- Red dots missing\n- Consecutive login quest not working\n- weekly leaderboard needs a new star icon because it\u2019s the same icon as all-time leaderboard\u2019s number-of-3-star-wins\n- "}}}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/trello/data.json", "pointer": "/actions/5150", "field": "idMemberCreator", "value": "PERSON_6097_TRELLO_USER_ID", "record": {"id": "68c4554e651fc25b077e01de", "type": "updateCard", "date": "2025-09-12T17:15:58Z", "idMemberCreator": "PERSON_6097_TRELLO_USER_ID", "idBoard": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "idCard": "68c451141c69fb8af1b4568e", "data": {"board": {"id": "6851a6569f3bf818760632ab", "name": "ZM ROADMAP", "shortLink": "HSqnngwQ"}, "card": {"desc": "- Red dots missing\n- Consecutive login quest not working\n- [Hard crash](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-475/consecutive-glass-impact-sfxvfx-causes-crash-on-android \"\u200c\") bug on Android after consecutive glass VFX/SFX\n- [Zombie track spawn is not consistent](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-438/investigate-why-some-zombie-tracks-do-not-spawn \"\u200c\") and causes level design imbalance.\n- [Fast matching targets an already dead zombies](https://linear.app/harmonygames-games/issue/ZOM-535/fast-matching-might-target-an-already-dead-zombie \"\u200c\").\n  - it's still happens for samsung devices, tha